This project provides independent integration templates for user-installed
Qualcomm QAIRT/QNN and Hexagon toolchains. Qualcomm SDK binaries are not part
of this repository.

The QNN compilation organization is informed by publicly available QNN
OpPackage examples and the mllm ecosystem. The public CustomAdd template does
not include mllm RMSNorm or RoPE source.

Hexagon-MLIR/Triton components are external development dependencies in source
mode. Generated kernel object publication remains subject to the provenance
and license review described in PUBLICATION.md.
